# Zmienne: .vscode/settings.json → rest-client.environmentVariables.$shared
# Wymaga sesji — uruchom Signin z auth.http (cookie jest współdzielone)

### Aktualizacja profilu
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "firstName": " Jan ",
  "lastName": " Kowalski ",
  "phone": "500600700",
  "address": "ul. Testowa 1",
  "postalCode": "00-001",
  "city": " Warszawa "
}

### Zmiana hasła (sesja zostaje)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Sprawdź sesję po zmianie hasła
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Żądanie zmiany emaila (pendingEmail w /auth/me)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "currentPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### Sprawdź pendingEmail
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
